# field-esc (h8-points-field): "abc" refused with Enter, then Escape —
# the base comes back and the edit ends with the focus back on the slider.
# Behaviour: the URL unchanged, the field "2.00" closed, the focus ring on
# the slider.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 293 716
wait 150
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
wait 100
type "abc"
wait 100
key Enter
wait 200
key Escape
wait 300
shot field-esc
